    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "¡Entendido! Aquí tienes la consulta SQL `SELECT` para BigQuery que filtra y obtiene las formulaciones genéricas estándar correspondientes a los Concept IDs `1396833` y `19060643` que has confirmado. Esta consulta busca conceptos relacionados en el vocabulario `RxNorm` que sean Ingredientes, Medicamentos Clínicos (Clinical Drug) o Grupos de Forma de Dosis Clínica (Clinical Dose Form Group), utilizando relaciones comunes de RxNorm como `has ingredient`, `ingredient of`, `form of`, `precise ingredient of`, y `has precise ingredient`.\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c1.concept_id AS reference_concept_id,\n    c1.concept_name AS reference_concept_name,\n    c1.vocabulary_id AS reference_vocabulary_id,\n    c1.concept_class_id AS reference_concept_class_id,\n    rel.relationship_name,\n    c2.concept_id AS generic_formulation_concept_id,\n    c2.concept_name AS generic_formulation_concept_name,\n    c2.vocabulary_id AS generic_formulation_vocabulary_id,\n    c2.concept_class_id AS generic_formulation_concept_class_id,\n    c2.standard_concept\nFROM\n    `concept` AS c1\nJOIN\n    `concept_relationship` AS cr\n    ON c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n    `relationship` AS rel\n    ON cr.relationship_id = rel.relationship_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c2\n    ON cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c1.concept_id IN (1396833, 19060643)\n    AND cr.relationship_id IN (\n        'RxNorm has ingredient',\n        'RxNorm ingredient of',\n        'RxNorm form of',\n        'RxNorm precise ingredient of',\n        'RxNorm has precise ingredient'\n    )\n    AND c2.vocabulary_id = 'RxNorm'\n    AND c2.domain_id = 'Drug'\n    AND c2.standard_concept = 'S'\n    AND c2.invalid_reason IS NULL\n    AND c2.concept_class_id IN ('Ingredient', 'Clinical Drug', 'Clinical Dose Form Group')\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnwBjz1rXzJwybDXI5aiydSjba74wMW_9M2Zd9vl1bJxaFz1IG7zqByRgBNCUMXATgUkS7tYHWpns0KpeOl5eUz-3-RfZqA8PYUZqneiD9jtpXsal1dDuWzKJAk03HFBsgceKKWlsPK-S_H_mgyqurHcJ9MMEo77Jam-9dK_"
